            {
              "id": "89c61f2d-4853-45e6-b3c6-66720db3bc80",
              "name": "Subject",
              "value": "Quick question about your listing pipeline",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0c6a1382-6242-4961-a4cc-98918a01ddef",
              "name": "Body",
              "value": "=Hi,\n\nQuick question, when new homeowners in your area decide to sell, how do they usually find your team?\n\nZillow and referrals are great, but they only capture sellers who are already looking.\nThere’s a much larger group of homeowners who are thinking about selling but haven’t raised their hand yet, and that’s where most listings are won.\n\nWe help real estate teams quietly reach these homeowners first using a multi-channel outbound engine (email, LinkedIn) that starts real conversations with:\n\n• Homeowners planning to sell in the next 3–12 months\n• Investors looking to buy in your area\n• Expired and off-market opportunities\n\nThis isn’t “branding” or ads — it’s direct conversations that turn into listing appointments and deals.\n\nWould you be open to seeing how many motivated sellers and buyers we can put in your pipeline each month in {{ $json.city }}?\n\nIf it looks useful, I can show you a short breakdown.\n\nBest,\nBuchi Nnamani\nOutreach Specialist for Real Estate Professionals",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "7aad2192-9ab6-4cac-8eb6-daa602d9270d",
              "name": "Email",
              "value": "={{ $json.data[0].email }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
